{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/bfbb28e54934cdd34d1cf4bce4bb1aa4.poster.webp?t=1758122659\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/bfbb28e54934cdd34d1cf4bce4bb1aa4.webp?t=1758122659\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the fight for humanity\u2019s survival in IRON GUARD: Salvation - a thrilling Tower Defense with strategy elements. Build defenses, upgrade turrets, and repel relentless robot waves with your handheld drone. Only your tactical brilliance can save humanity across battles on various planets including the hostile world of Acris.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/8025de4da2ac6e87321a18cc855fa922.poster.webp?t=1758122659\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/8025de4da2ac6e87321a18cc855fa922.webp?t=1758122659\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fast-paced gameplay</strong> \u2013 enemies adapt to each battle. Choose your difficulty and how to play: oversee from above or manually fire from your drone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\udb40\udc6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 <strong>30 hand-crafted levels</strong> across many planets \u2013 each with new obstacles and strategic opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\udb40\udc6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Multiple modes and mechanics.</strong> Play in different styles, adapt each run, and climb the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\udb40\udc6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Formidable foes</strong> \u2013 distinct enemy tactics test your skills. Carefully choose and combine turrets, and make full use of battlefield opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\udb40\udc6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Upgrades and resource management</strong> \u2013 level up turrets and drone; use harvesters, minerals, and factories for a steady resource flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\udb40\udc6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Command heroes</strong> \u2013 control Graves, Irina, and Mitchell, each with unique abilities that can shift the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\udb40\udc6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Tactical control</strong> \u2013 command from above, or shrink into the action and immerse yourself in a giant\u2019s world of turrets and machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\udb40\udc6a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Arsenal of possibilities</strong> \u2013 choose from 25+ turrets, move platforms to adapt defenses, deploy superweapons, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/c9931044f9d76e09d14029d8124913c4.poster.webp?t=1758122659\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1861410/extras/c9931044f9d76e09d14029d8124913c4.webp?t=1758122659\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=200 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1861410?t=1758122659","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat